# These *.bin fixtures carry literal VT protocol bytes, including CR LF pairs
# that are the stream's own line endings, not this repo's text convention.
# Without this, a checkout under core.autocrlf=input (or Windows autocrlf=true)
# silently drops the CR half of every \r\n, corrupting the fixture in a way
# `go run ./testdata/vt/gen` can never reproduce and no golden re-run catches
# until someone re-clones.
*.bin binary
